{"id":"ecc97d1e32c32b62","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-prop-cardinal.md","title":"Cardinal Properties","display":"prop-cardinal — Cardinal Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-cardinal","aliases":["58-prop-cardinal"],"display":"prop-cardinal — Cardinal Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-cardinal — Cardinal Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa\\ne0\n\\land\\lambda\\ne0\n\\land(\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\lor\\omega\\subseteq\\lambda)\n\\to\n\\kappa\\cdot\\lambda=\\max(\\kappa,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa\\ne0\n\\land\\lambda\\ne0\n\\land(\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\lor\\omega\\subseteq\\lambda)\n\\to\n\\kappa\\cdot\\lambda=\\max(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For infinite cardinals, multiplication equals the maximum.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa + \\lambda = \\max(\\kappa, \\lambda)\">\\(\\kappa + \\lambda = \\max(\\kappa, \\lambda)\\)</span> for infinite cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa\\ne0\n\\land\\lambda\\ne0\n\\land(\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\lor\\omega\\subseteq\\lambda)\n\\to\n\\kappa\\cdot\\lambda=\\max(\\kappa,\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa + \\lambda = \\max(\\kappa, \\lambda)","display":false}],"bytes":819,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3938","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-prop-cardinal.md|58-prop-cardinal]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}